    /// Obtain the graphics memory summary of application.
    ///
    /// # Arguments
    ///
    /// * `interval` - If the cache of graphics memory is longer than interval (unit: second), the latest
    /// graphics memory data will be obtained. The interval value range is 2 seconds to
    /// 3600 seconds, If interval is an invalid value, the default value is 300 seconds.
    ///
    /// * `summary` - Indicates value of graphics memory summary, in kibibytes.
    ///
    /// # Returns
    ///
    /// * Result code
    /// [`HIDEBUG_SUCCESS`] Get graphics memory success.
    /// [`HIDEBUG_INVALID_ARGUMENT`] Invalid argument, value is null.
    /// [`HIDEBUG_TRACE_ABNORMAL`] Failed to get the application memory due to a remote exception.
    ///
    /// Available since API-level: 21
